# Project rules

The canonical, always-applicable rules for this repository live in **`/CLAUDE.md`** (Cursor
also reads the root `AGENTS.md`, which is a symlink to it). Read it in full before working.

`CLAUDE.md` is a **router**: start from its "Start here — context map" and load the
task-relevant files (`TODO.md`, `README.md` `## Features`, `docs/tests.md`, `docs/configuration.md`,
`docs/architecture.md`, `docs/sandbox-testing.md`, `skills/*/SKILL.md`) before acting. Do not
work from this pointer or from `CLAUDE.md` alone.

Three hard rules to remember:
- **Design before code** — no implementation (not even tests) until the design is finished and
  any architectural decision is approved.
- **Doc-sync in the same change** — update docs/tests/CHANGELOG when code changes; CI enforces it.
- **Never send real Telegram messages** outside the dedicated sandbox test account/group.
